# Graphify knowledge graph

This project has a Graphify graph at `graphify-out/`.

- Before exploring with Read/Grep/Glob, run `graphify query`, `graphify path`, or `graphify explain`.
- After modifying source files, run `graphify update .`.
- Prefer `graphify-out/wiki/index.md` when it exists.
